<section class="whitepapers-page">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="whitepapers-header">
      <h1>Whitepaper</h1>
      <h3>The Autonomous Work Layer: From Human Execution to Agent Orchestration</h3>
      <p>Exploring how AI agents are reshaping the operating model — moving organisations from human-led execution to intelligent agent orchestration at scale.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="whitepaper-card" id="wp1">
      <div class="whitepaper-content">
        <h2>The Autonomous Work Layer: From Human Execution to Agent Orchestration</h2>
        <p class="wp-lead">AI agents are no longer a future capability — they are rewriting how software companies operate, deliver, and scale. Yet most PE-backed SaaS businesses are still bolting AI features onto legacy operating models, capturing a fraction of the value available.</p>
        <p>This whitepaper introduces the concept of the <strong>Autonomous Work Layer</strong> — a new operating architecture where AI agents handle execution, humans shift to orchestration, and product strategy becomes the system that connects the two. It examines why the current wave of AI adoption is stalling for most companies, and what the highest-performing organisations are doing differently to pull ahead.</p>
        <p>It provides a practical framework for identifying which workflows to automate, which to augment, and which to leave human-led — then shows how to restructure product teams and operating models around agent orchestration without disrupting core delivery.</p>
        <p>Drawing on real-world patterns from PE-backed SaaS environments, it demonstrates how this shift has driven measurable gains in margin, velocity, and valuation — and lays out what it takes to make the transition stick.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="whitepaper-action">
        <button class="btn wp-toggle" data-target="wp1">Download PDF &darr;</button>
      </div>
      <div class="wp-form-wrap">
        <form class="wp-form" id="wpForm1">
          <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Whitepaper Download: The Autonomous Work Layer">
